      "text": "值房炭盆旁，一夜没合眼的秦烈正擦拭着手中鬼头大刀。抬头看见陆烬推门进来，这位筑基中期的沙场老将握刀的手忽然顿在半空，独目狐疑地上下扫了陆烬两遍。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c040_qin_lie_p062",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "text": "[whispers] 怪事……老子怎么觉着你小子身上那股血腥气突然收得一干二净，站在这儿跟块深潭顽石似的连点动静都没了？龙鲤血喝下去了？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "秦烈狐疑惊叹陆烬深潭顽石般的气机"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c041_lu_jin_p063",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "text": "[calmly] 托秦伯父的福，侥幸成了，筋骨总算迈过了那道坎。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬含蓄应答"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c042_nar_p063",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "陆烬含蓄应道，并未点破无瑕筑基的惊世骇俗。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c043_qin_lie_p064",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "text": "[sighs] 成了就好！成了总算多三分保命本钱！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "秦烈长舒一口气"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c044_nar_p064",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "秦烈长舒一口气，随即神色骤然凝重下来，压低嗓门道。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c045_qin_lie_p064",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "text": "[hoarsely] [whispers] 你回来得正好，半个时辰前衙门刚接到赤松岭那边的线报——玄剑宗那个姓裴的小畜生已经冲破筑基中期提前出关了！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "秦烈凝重通报裴玄度破筑基中期提前出关"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c046_nar_p065",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "陆烬眸光微凝。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
