      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "text": "[coldly] 裴玄度出关了？十月十五的纳妾大典呢？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬眸光微凝"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c048_qin_lie_p066",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "text": "[angry] [hoarsely] 那小畜生许是因为百草庄被烧缺了辅药，等不及十五月圆了，刚放出风声，要把纳苏家丫头的日子提前到十月初六！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "纳妾提前至十月初六"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c049_nar_p066",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "秦烈咬牙切齿地低声骂道。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c050_qin_lie_p066",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "text": "[hoarsely] 而且玄剑宗山上还派了三名筑基后期的内门执事长老随行护法，明早便到赤松岭别院。这几天你小子千万缩在镇渊司军营里别单独落单，省得那疯狗腾出手来咬你！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "三大筑基后期长老护驾"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c051_nar_p067",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "十月初六么，距离今天只剩五天了。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c052_nar_p068",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "陆烬摸了摸怀中那只从三百丈寒潭女尸腕骨上褪下来的染血白玉镯，眼底深处浮起一抹冰冷彻骨的笑意。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c053_lu_jin_p068",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "text": "[coldly] 多谢秦伯父提醒，侄儿心里有数。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬抚摸染血玉镯冷笑布局"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c054_nar_p069",
      "act_id": "act4_pei_xuandu_emerges_early",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "text": "裴玄度既然急着在初六之前备齐炉鼎，那他今夜便先送苏清寒一份大礼，看看这赤松岭别院的后院，能不能先自己烧起来！",
